      "writtenOn": "2021-01-13T03:44:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This code seems to invalidate the phonebook cache whenever any file is updated using REFRESH.\nThis seems a bit odd.\n\nFor example, it\u0027s very common that EF with voicemail indicator is refreshed. So, in that case, we would invalidate the phonebook cache?\n\nShouldn\u0027t we add conditions on which files are updated so that we only consider those that are part of the phonebook?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 461,
        "startChar": 24,
        "endLine": 461,
        "endChar": 97
      },
      "revId": "0aef2960c86e4a009c04126cff6829d865b00663",
