      "writtenOn": "2021-01-14T19:16:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the file is in the phonebook DF is certainly one option. But not sure if that is sufficient for you (sorry, I have not worked with Phonebook for a long time...).\n\nThe important thing is that we avoid refreshing the cache for each and every refresh, as that is not necessary and would lead to much higher traffic between Android and modem, especially for large phonebooks.",
      "parentUuid": "c601106f_d7abafb9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 461,
        "startChar": 24,
        "endLine": 461,
        "endChar": 97
      },
      "revId": "0aef2960c86e4a009c04126cff6829d865b00663",
